// StartConsumerLoop starts a background loop which periodically consumes sequenced entries,
// passing them to f each time they are consumed.
//
// The loop will consume any sequenced entries which are waiting to be consumed as soon as it is
// started, and will check for newly sequenced entries at the given interval thereafter.
